@startuml hash_chain
title Структура хэш-цепочки блокчейн-реестра

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #333333
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

rectangle "Блок 0 (genesis)" as B0 {
  card "height = 0" as B0h
  card "tx: Mint" as B0t
  card "prev_hash = 0" as B0p
}

rectangle "Блок 1" as B1 {
  card "height = 1" as B1h
  card "tx: Transfer" as B1t
  card "prev_hash =\nSHA256(блок 0)" as B1p
}

rectangle "Блок 2" as B2 {
  card "height = 2" as B2h
  card "tx: Burn" as B2t
  card "prev_hash =\nSHA256(блок 1)" as B2p
}

rectangle "Блок 3" as B3 {
  card "height = 3" as B3h
  card "tx: Transfer" as B3t
  card "prev_hash =\nSHA256(блок 2)" as B3p
}

B0 -right-> B1 : hash
B1 -right-> B2 : hash
B2 -right-> B3 : hash

note bottom of B1
  SHA256(height || tx || prev_hash)
  Подмена любого поля меняет хэш блока
  --> рвётся связка со всеми последующими
  --> verify() сообщает индекс повреждённого блока
end note

@enduml
